Package: geneviewer
Type: Package
Title: Gene Cluster Visualizations
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Niels",
                  family = "van der Velden",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "n.s.j.vandervelden@gmail.com"),
             person("Mike", "Bostock", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
                    comment = "Bundled D3 library"),
             person("Fonticons, Inc.", role = "cph",
                    comment = "Font Awesome Free icons in the bundled JavaScript"))
Maintainer: Niels van der Velden <n.s.j.vandervelden@gmail.com>
Description: Provides tools for plotting gene clusters and transcripts by 
  importing data from GenBank, FASTA, and GFF files. It performs global 
  pairwise protein alignments and 'MUMmer' alignments [Needleman and Wunsch (1970)
  <doi:10.1016/0022-2836(70)90057-4>; Delcher et al. (1999)
  <doi:10.1093/nar/27.11.2369>] and displays results on gene arrow maps.
  Extensive customization options are available, including legends, labels,
  annotations, scales, colors, tooltips, and more.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
SystemRequirements: MUMmer (optional, used by mummer_alignment())
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
